  "items": [
   {
    "text": "Saturn's rings are",
    "start": 10,
    "end": 71
   },
   {
    "text": "about 10 meters thick,",
    "start": 71,
    "end": 152
   },
   {
    "text": "yet 270,000 km",
    "start": 166,
    "end": 278
   },
   {
    "text": "across.",
    "start": 278,
    "end": 345
   },
   {
    "text": "Between Earth",
    "start": 361,
    "end": 399
   },
   {
    "text": "and the Moon,",
    "start": 399,
    "end": 444
   },
   {
    "text": "they'd span 70%",
    "start": 453,
    "end": 520
   },
   {
    "text": "of the gap.",
    "start": 520,
    "end": 578
   },
   {
    "text": "Shrink them",
    "start": 637,
    "end": 672
   },
   {
    "text": "to paper thickness,",
    "start": 672,
    "end": 738
   },
   {
    "text": "and they'd still be",
    "start": 750,
    "end": 827
   },
   {
    "text": "almost 3 km across.",
    "start": 827,
    "end": 911
   },
   {
    "text": "Up close, they split",
    "start": 961,
    "end": 1031
   },
   {
    "text": "into ringlets and gaps,",
    "start": 1031,
    "end": 1118
   },
   {
    "text": "one kept open by a moon",
    "start": 1132,
    "end": 1250
   },
   {
    "text": "just 28 km wide.",
    "start": 1250,
    "end": 1341
   },
   {
    "text": "They're not solid:",
    "start": 1495,
    "end": 1560
   },
   {
    "text": "countless chunks",
    "start": 1597,
    "end": 1656
   },
   {
    "text": "of almost pure water ice,",
    "start": 1656,
    "end": 1753
   },
   {
    "text": "from specks of dust",
    "start": 1766,
    "end": 1834
   },
   {
    "text": "to blocks",
    "start": 1834,
    "end": 1869
   },
   {
    "text": "as big as a house.",
    "start": 1869,
    "end": 1941
   },
   {
    "text": "Each circles Saturn",
    "start": 1951,
    "end": 2053
   },
   {
    "text": "at about 60,000 km/h,",
    "start": 2053,
    "end": 2172
   },
   {
    "text": "yet neighbors drift by",
    "start": 2185,
    "end": 2263
   },
   {
    "text": "at a snail's pace:",
    "start": 2263,
    "end": 2334
   },
   {
    "text": "millimeters per second.",
    "start": 2351,
    "end": 2433
   },
   {
    "text": "Crush all that ice",
    "start": 2455,
    "end": 2519
   },
   {
    "text": "into one ball:",
    "start": 2519,
    "end": 2577
   },
   {
    "text": "about 320 km wide,",
    "start": 2590,
    "end": 2759
   },
   {
    "text": "smaller than",
    "start": 2778,
    "end": 2821
   },
   {
    "text": "Saturn's little moon",
    "start": 2821,
    "end": 2889
   },
   {
